+## CI Pipeline
+
+The existing CI pipeline is unchanged for this release. The two jobs defined in `.github/workflows/ci.yml` -- the Lint job (shellcheck + bash-3.2 ban-list grep) and the BATS-under-bash:3.2 job -- already cover every test file in this release's scope. No workflow file changes are required.
+
+The replan gate for Phase 1 (per `phasing.md`) requires this pipeline to pass with zero regressions against the hardening branch baseline. The workflow file path for traceability is `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.
